# tests/win/vm-run.sh's own check (T16): the VM's facts as SYSTEM, a step as the logged-in user
# through hidden.exe and through conhost --headless (no window either way), and the served build.
#   tests/win/vm-run.sh run "clean Windows" smoke
# MODE        SECS NAME          SCRIPT
need http
